  "description": "The Firmstrong Urban Lady Single Speed Women’s Beach Cruiser Bike is smooth riding, easy to pedal, and a lot of fun. This is a great ladies' bicycle that is ideal for the recreational rider who wants to ride casually and desires a simple bicycle that is fun and easy to operate. Featuring a classic step-through frame, it allows for easy mounting and dismounting, making it perfect for every outing.\n\nThe Urban Lady has one gear and one brake, so riding and operating this cruiser bike is simple—even for those of us who haven’t ridden in a long time or aren’t fully comfortable on two wheels. Trust us here at Firmstrong, “it’s just like riding a bike.” With no cables hanging off the frame or complicated gear systems, the Urban Lady is a low-maintenance bicycle that does exactly as advertised. It makes every bike ride fun, relaxing, and incredibly comfortable.\n\nThe ride is smooth and effortless; the wide tires and oversized comfortable spring saddle make the ride soft and stable. The brake system is a coaster brake, which means the rider simply pedals backwards to stop—just like the original beach cruisers.\n\nDon’t let the single-speed configuration fool you; it is designed to serve the differing needs of various riders. While it has only one gear, you will still be able to maintain a consistent cruising speed of 5 to 15 mph. In addition, riding up light hills is not out of the question. While gears make uphill riding easier, the Urban Lady’s durable steel frame and efficient design make casual inclines achievable.\n\n15” Steel Frame with 26” Aluminum Wheels\n\nSingle Speed Bike with a Pedal-Backwards Coaster Brake for easy pedaling and smooth braking\n\nDual Spring Oversized Seat for Added Comfort\n\n2.125” Wide White-Wall Tires provides a cushioned, relaxed ride for easy rolling\n\n28.5” Wide Cruiser Bike Handlebars with Hi-Density Foam Grips\n\nBicycle Weighs 32.5 lbs. Fully Assembled\n\nFits Most Women 5’2\" – 5’11\" Tall\n\nRecommended Riding Speed 3 – 15mph\n\nRecommended Riding Distance 0 – 20 miles in a single trip\n\nThe Seat and Handlebar Height and Tilt can be adjusted to properly fit the rider\n\nColor Matched Fenders can be Purchased Separately for $49.99.\n\nBike comes 80% Assembled, Assembly is easy and fun!\n\nDesigned in Hermosa Beach, CA",
